## Example

```python
from nimbus.errors import ApiError, TransportError

try:
    client.send(message="ping", topic="health")
except ApiError as e:
    if e.retryable:
        schedule_retry(e.code)
except TransportError:
    schedule_retry("TRANSPORT")
```
